11. FREE LLM API / TOKEN / LIMIT UNDERSTANDING

==================================================



FreeLLMAPI does NOT magically make all Claude usage free.



It acts as a gateway/router to available provider APIs.



Each provider has its own:

- Rate limits

- Token limits

- Daily/monthly quotas

- Model availability

- Tool support

- API restrictions



Multiple keys from the same provider should NOT be treated as unlimited quota.



The goal is to diversify across different providers.



Example:



    Gemini hits 429

        ↓

    FreeLLMAPI

        ↓

    Try another eligible provider/model

        ↓

    Continue request



