Resume latest session.



    claude --resume

    claude -r



Open session picker.



Inside Claude Code:



    /resume



Switch/resume another session.



    /rename name



Rename current session.



Then a named session can be resumed with:



    claude --resume name



    /clear



Starts a fresh conversation context, but previous session remains resumable.



    /compact



Compacts/summarizes current context without creating a completely new session.



Claude Code session files are stored under:



    ~/.claude/projects/



